### django-rest-authemail¶ {#django-rest-authemail}

django-rest-authemail (https://github.com/celiao/django-rest-authemail)
provides a RESTful API interface for user signup and authentication. Email addresses are used for authentication, rather than usernames.  API endpoints are available for signup, signup email verification, login, logout, password reset, password reset verification, email change, email change verification, password change, and user detail.  A fully functional example project and detailed instructions are included.

